<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00223/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一桶盛有约250ml面汤的泡面，底部不可见。可以不断地从中捞出面渣与脱水蔬菜。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>位于Site-CN-██的生物实验室内。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>一次测试中将面汤倒出后失去异常性质。后将面汤倒回并冷藏。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>虽然因为违反实验室规定而扣了工资，但我没喝汤就吃饱这可是第一次。</em>——Dr.Kalis<br />
<em>然后为了检测同一批泡面是否异常，半个部门的人被鼓励着吃了三天泡面。</em>——Dr.Lujeff</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00223" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00223" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00223-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lujeff-kalis" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5460271); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5460271&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607586309" alt="Lujeff Kalis" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5460271)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lujeff-kalis" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5460271); return false;">Lujeff Kalis</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1590758040 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">29 May 2020 13:14</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00113/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一台███牌的电冰箱，在打开时会将周围的室温升高至5█℃。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>201█/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-82员工食堂<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>Site-CN-82中价值物品仓库。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>申请开设桑拿房。</em>-刚刚检查仓库回来的Dr.Leo<br />
<em>原因？</em>-Site-CN-82站点主管██████<br />
<em>这不仅关系到异常物品的保存，而且关系到我们站点的电费——您能够想象一打开仓库有半个仓库的研究员在用这玩意撒上水蒸桑拿吗？</em>-被一堆研究员拿着记忆删除喷雾追了半个站点的Dr.Leo<br />
<em>拒······批准。</em>-Site-CN-82站点主管██████<br />
-</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00113" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00113" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00113-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leeeeeeoooooo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6158338); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6158338&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607586309" alt="LEEEEEEOOOOOO" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6158338)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leeeeeeoooooo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6158338); return false;">LEEEEEEOOOOOO</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1587818740 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">25 Apr 2020 12:45</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00409/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一只拳套，戴上后使用者只能使出<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/left-punch/">左勾拳</a>以对敌<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>██市██仓库<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>收藏在Site-CN-81低价值物品柜中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>这个东西除了能打出连续普通拳以外还有什么作用？——Dr.阙</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00409" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00409" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00409-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zeta-9-beta" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6441401); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6441401&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607586309" alt="zeta-9-beta" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6441401)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zeta-9-beta" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6441401); return false;">zeta-9-beta</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1601084223 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">26 Sep 2020 01:37</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00471/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一把普通的乌木椅子，但除了方琪博士外的如何基金会员工都会认为项目具有重大研究价值，并尝试将其归为SCP项目。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>方琪博士的个人实验室<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被方琪博士牢牢地嵌在了其实验室的水泥地上<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>方琪博士：那只是我姐留下的一把普通的乌木椅子啊，我只是喜欢ta才带到基金会的呀！<br />
Dr.Give Up:我知道了！你才是SCP-2066██本体吧！而那椅子就是SCP-2066██-1！<br />
方琪博士：啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！！！</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00471" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00471" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00471-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/i-give-up" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6937520); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6937520&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607586309" alt="I give up" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6937520)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/i-give-up" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6937520); return false;">I give up</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1606644660 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">29 Nov 2020 10:11</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00014/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个马克杯，当其内部装有任何液体时，将无法采用除饮用外的其他任何手段使其内部的液体与该项目分离。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>██省██市<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>于Site-CN-03无价值物品收容区<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>不要往这里面装一些奇奇怪怪的东西，否则谁装的就由谁来负责喝掉。</em>——站点主管██</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00014" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00014" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00014-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miku1314" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4546338); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4546338&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607586309" alt="miku1314" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4546338)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miku1314" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4546338); return false;">miku1314</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1585806218 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">02 Apr 2020 05:43</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00211/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>项目为Site-CN-10厕所中的部分门锁。在有人进入时有一定几率自动反锁并一段时间内无法在保持锁体完好状况下使用外力打开，当进入对象进入极度绝望状态下将自动打开。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-10的厕所<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>已被更换<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>我终于知道为什么站点里的女员工都会怪力了</em>——特工Accipiter</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00211" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00211" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00211-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-aurora-owl" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6126100); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6126100&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607586309" alt="Dr Aurora Owl" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6126100)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-aurora-owl" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6126100); return false;">Dr Aurora Owl</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1589848038 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">19 May 2020 00:27</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00398/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一支原产于比利时的FN FNC突击步枪，只有在弹匣井内插有巧克力块时才能射出子弹。若插入正常弹匣，则项目只会射出5.56×45mm子弹形状的巧克力。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>武警部队特种警察大队██仓库<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>收容于Site-CN-██异常武器收容单元<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>射出的巧克力吃起来特别甜。</em>——Dr. Kleiner</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00398" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00398" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00398-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kayo-kesr-aquas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5232386); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5232386&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607586309" alt="Kayo_Kesr_Aquas" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5232386)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kayo-kesr-aquas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5232386); return false;">Kayo_Kesr_Aquas</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1600577702 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">20 Sep 2020 04:55</span></p>
</div>
